| `input_adb_lookup(demo.csv)`
```### Split multivalue fields ###```
| foreach nt_host [eval <<FIELD>>=split(<<FIELD>>, "|")]
```### Convert case insensitive fields to lowercase ###```
| foreach nt_host [eval <<FIELD>>=lower(<<FIELD>>)]
```### Map source lookup to source name ###```
| eval source=case(source_lookup="demo.csv", "demo")
```### Build match keys (lowercased where the field is case insensitive) ###```
| eval adbk_nt_host = nt_host
```### Shallow merge assets with matching key fields (using basic stats) ###```
| eval _key = adbk_nt_host
| search _key=*
```### Sort newest first (multivalue fields keep their most recent values) ###```
| sort 0 -_time
| stats values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(_time) as last_seen, latest(_time) as _time, values(adbk_nt_host) as adbk_nt_host, list(nt_host) as nt_host, latest(owner) as owner by _key
```### Deep merge assets with matching key fields (using custom command) ###```
| eval _key = adbk_nt_host
| adbmerge max_keys=25
| eval _key = md5(mvjoin(mvsort(asset), "::"))
| sort 0 -_time
| stats values(asset) as asset, values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(last_seen) as last_seen, list(nt_host) as nt_host, latest(owner) as owner by _key
```### De-duplicate multivalue fields (order is kept) ###```
| eval nt_host = mvdedup(nt_host)
```### Trim multivalue fields ###```
| eval nt_host = mvindex(nt_host,0,4)
```### Output to KV store ###```
| table _key, asset, source, source_lookup, last_seen, nt_host, owner
| outputlookup assetdb
